            <div xml:id="d602">

                <pb facs="0715" n="597" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg597"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363/478: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Matthews</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-09-28T11:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 28,
                                1928—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:10
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>110. The Senate committee unanimously approved article 2 of petroleum bill with
                    following addition: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Therefore the competent authority may decree on petition of a
                            legitimately interested party the expropriations necessary for the
                            exercise and development of said industry.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthews</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
